191
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,180
(He's in for a whole episode of teasing)

192
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,000
What's that door for?

193
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,320
Is this that Werewolf

194
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:45,920
