201
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,840
(Automatic Door Troublemaker)
There's an orange circle on it.

202
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,440
Your job is

203
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,000
to carry the human prop

204
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,280
(Starting point)
from the starting line,

205
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,640
around the small hill,

206
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:05,200
(Sensor door)
and over to the sensor door.

207
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,200
Use the human prop's

208
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:07,560
designated body part

209
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,600
(Target successfully touched)
to touch the circle

210
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,640
and unlock the door.

211
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,760
During the challenge, one chosen player

212
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:12,960
(Hu Xianxu)
must wear a straw hat

213
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,280
(No one may touch the hat with their hands)
holding ten ping-pong balls.

214
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,960
(Only elbows can keep the hat from falling)
The human prop can't move on their own.

215
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:19,160
(The human prop can't use their own strength)
Everyone else can only use their elbows

216
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,680
(Jia Bing)
to keep the hat steady.

217
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,800
Meanwhile, two Impostors

218
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,480
(Impostors must hide their identities)
will secretly sabotage the mission

219
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,960
(Stop the mission from succeeding)
to prevent the door from unlocking.

220
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,840
(Bai Jingting)
If more than five ping-pong balls

221
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:27,800
fall out of the hat,

222
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,120
or you fail to complete
the required move,

223
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,280
(Fan Chengcheng)
you lose the round.

224
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:34,000
After a loss, everyone must discuss

225
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,280
and eliminate one player.

226
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,560
Best of three wins.

227
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,000
How many Impostors?

228
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:38,320
Two.

229
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,720
Let's draw our role cards.

230
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:43,260
(Drawing random role cards)

231
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:48,640
Let's go.

232
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:50,880
Okay, let's go.

233
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:56,780
(Taking off her sunglasses)

234
00:07:58,880 --> 00:07:59,680
Oh, Churan.

235
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:02,880
Help me

236
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,680
