237
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,440
Did you have to walk that far to say it?

238
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:09,800
Well, thanks.

239
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,600
Thanks.

240
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,600
Come on.

241
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,640
Thanks.

242
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:17,760
(Automatic Door Troublemaker begins)
Everyone, close your eyes.

243
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:23,400
Impostors, open your eyes.

244
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:33,540
(Impostors: Fan Chengcheng
and Li Yunrui)

245
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:34,640
I know who it is.

246
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,720
Someone laughed out loud, right?

247
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,320
