259
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,360
Open your eyes.

260
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:09,020
This round, Teng must use his chest...

261
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:09,640
(Human prop: Shen Teng)

262
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,080
(Chosen body part: Chest)
To touch the circle.

263
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:14,020
